#: af9dd5e299b34371820ccc1561e9c35a
msgid ""
"Windows ISOs can be downloaded directly from Microsoft (e.g., `here <https://"
"www.microsoft.com/en-us/software-download/windows10ISO>`__ for Win10), or "
"selected and downloaded via the `Windows Media Creation Tool <https://go."
