"can be found on the net, although obviously you should consider them even "
"“unsafer” than MS-provided ISOs. Alternatively, one could download an "
"official ISO and run scripts/apply patches before installation. Some of the "
"“tweaks” might end up being too much depending on the qube’s planned usage, "
"though (e.g., no appx functionality in ameliorated Windows - so the "
"installation of Windows Store apps is impossible, even with PowerShell)."
msgstr ""

